From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 18:40:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Compact DOM/layout storage and pool per-node allocations

Move presentational_hints into ElementRare (ElementData 64->56 B on wasm32), gate content_box_subpixel_offset on writing-mode (TextLayout 52->44 B on wasm32), pool TextLayout/EvictedLayout/EvictedBreak via PoolBox, compact LayoutData (shared order, [f32; 4] scrollable_overflow, lazy pooled unrounded), and store single-attribute Attributes in a tagged PoolBox<Attribute>.

Signed-off-by: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
